@startuml SEntity
title SEntity — State Machine (7 states)

hide empty description

[*] --> Start

Start --> Stop     : [currLoc == deliveryNodeName]
Start --> Scanning : [currLoc != deliveryNodeName]\n/ doScanning()

Scanning --> Scanning : [no transport selected]\n/ schedule(now + SCAN_INTERVAL)
Scanning --> Waiting  : [backlog selected]\n/ appendReservation()\n(TEntity drives next transition)

Waiting --> Loading   : TEntity calls notifyPickUp(serial)\n→ SEntity.receivePickUp(t)\n/ verifyPrePickup(), setLoc(t.name)\n/ logPickUp(), recordPickup()

Loading --> Moving    : TEntity.finaliseLoading() calls\nnotifyDeparture(this SEntity)\n/ state = Moving

Moving --> Unloading  : TEntity.doMoving() calls\nnotifyArrival(this SEntity)\n/ state = Unloading

Unloading --> Stop    : TEntity calls notifyDropOff(serial)\n→ SEntity.receiveDO(t)\n[currLoc == deliveryNodeName]\n/ setLoc(node), logDropOff()\n/ verifyPostDropoff()

Unloading --> Scanning : TEntity calls notifyDropOff(serial)\n→ SEntity.receiveDO(t)\n[currLoc != deliveryNodeName]\n/ setLoc(node), logDropOff()\n/ verifyPostDropoff(), doScanning()

Stop --> [*]

note right of Waiting
  Loading, Moving, and Unloading
  are passive: process() is a no-op.
  All transitions are driven by
  direct TEntity method calls,
  not DES EntEvents.
end note

note right of Scanning
  Uses SerialController.selectBacklog()
  on transports at currLoc.
  SCAN_INTERVAL = 2.0 h

  currLoc is ALWAYS set:
    node name      — when at a node
    transport name — when aboard
end note

note right of Loading
  TravelLog.validP() checked:
    BEFORE receivePickUp (pre-condition)
    AFTER  receiveDO     (post-condition)
end note

@enduml
